Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So this year, MENDAKI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,is introducing the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for School vouchers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,which we hope to help kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,from Primary One
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,all the way up to university.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So, as we begin the school year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,as you know, for many parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,it's also a time where
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,there are a lot of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,expenses for school
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.06,0:00:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and we want our kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to have the best start in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You have things like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,schoolbooks, textbooks, uniforms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and other expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.58,0:00:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,that parents have to fork out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And during these times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when you have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,cost of living concerns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,challenging times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we want to help parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,from low-income families
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,to support their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This year, MENDAKI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,is giving out $250 e-vouchers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,that parents can use
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,for their children
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it's schoolbooks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.14,0:00:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it is stationery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,or even shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We are pegging it at about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,$1,000 per capita income
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So we expect more than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,22,000 students
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,who could benefit from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.88,0:00:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's an application basis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and we start to take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,applications from 1st December.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.78,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So we hope that this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.72,0:00:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,will do its part
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to help parents and children
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,have a good start for the year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and not to worry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,about some of these expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,that would have otherwise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,held them back.
